{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a long-forgotten world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A century has passed since a malevolent plague erupted from the earth, extinguishing nearly all life. Now the land lies in ruin \u2014 scattered villages, broken kingdoms, and whispers of the plague\u2019s return. Venture into these decaying remnants to uncover the truth and prevent the next awakening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/181dad3359418595576eed89149534ed.poster.avif?t=1757044134\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/181dad3359418595576eed89149534ed.webm?t=1757044134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/181dad3359418595576eed89149534ed.mp4?t=1757044134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather your allies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the darkness alone or rally up to ten players in co-op play. Battle through shifting dungeons, cut down hordes of the infected, and forge powerful builds as you hunt the plague at its source. You are Plagueborn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/980551ff8c04f18668cf833b95836cc9.poster.avif?t=1757044134\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/980551ff8c04f18668cf833b95836cc9.webm?t=1757044134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/980551ff8c04f18668cf833b95836cc9.mp4?t=1757044134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master unique weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide arsenal of distinct weapons, each with its own playstyle and abilities. From brutal axes and shields to swift daggers and mystical staves, every weapon opens the door to new strategies and builds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/ca8827d21edc027ce4c872fa5ebf2270.poster.avif?t=1757044134\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/ca8827d21edc027ce4c872fa5ebf2270.webm?t=1757044134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/ca8827d21edc027ce4c872fa5ebf2270.mp4?t=1757044134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge your build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover passives, blessings, and rare relics that transform your character each run. Combine weapons and upgrades to create powerful synergies \u2014 no two journeys through the plague will ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2774130?t=1757044134","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757044134","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/5716e422b39a1d73b9cbadefb2b90ee80214b60f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757044134","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/5716e422b39a1d73b9cbadefb2b90ee80214b60f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757044134","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a long-forgotten world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A century has passed since a malevolent plague erupted from the earth, extinguishing nearly all life. Now the land lies in ruin \u2014 scattered villages, broken kingdoms, and whispers of the plague\u2019s return. Venture into these decaying remnants to uncover the truth and prevent the next awakening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/181dad3359418595576eed89149534ed.poster.avif?t=1757044134\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/181dad3359418595576eed89149534ed.webm?t=1757044134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/181dad3359418595576eed89149534ed.mp4?t=1757044134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather your allies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the darkness alone or rally up to ten players in co-op play. Battle through shifting dungeons, cut down hordes of the infected, and forge powerful builds as you hunt the plague at its source. You are Plagueborn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774130/extras/980551ff8c04f18668cf833b95836cc9.poster.avif?t=1757044134\" 